                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Is this game worth it.\n\nLong answer: 62 hours later i get my first air to air kill against a real player. The feeling was like no other, yes it may be a video game but for that moment I was in the plane, in control of this little piece of chaos called a P-51 mustang. When I saw my rounds fly true and reduce my target (BF109) to a fireball and split his right wing in two, I had no words. I did not cheer, I was excited yes, but all the past 62 hours lead up to this one moment, perfect timing, perfect angle and perfect shots was 62 hours of luck and skill, and from now on I was HOOKED. \n\nShort answer: Game good, plane go \"BAM BAM BAM BAM\"  and enemy plane goes \"WERRRRRRrrrrrrrrrr BOOM!\"\n\nIf you want a challenge get good at this game. If not play warthunder.\n\n",
